---
title: Concerts
description: Upcoming Illinois and Indiana shows for artists and venues I follow.
eleventyNavigation:
  key: Concerts
  order: 6
---
<h1>Concerts</h1>

{% set errors = concerts.errors %}{% include "build-errors.njk" %}

<table>
	<thead>
		<tr><th>When</th><th>Artist</th><th>Where</th></tr>
	</thead>
	<tbody>
	{%- for show in concerts.shows %}
		<tr>
			<td style="white-space: nowrap">{{ show.when }}</td>
			<td><a href="{{ show.url }}">{{ show.artist }}</a>{% if show.onSale %}<br><small>On sale {{ show.onSale }}</small>{% endif %}</td>
			<td>{% if show.venue %}{{ show.venue }}<br>{% endif %}<small>{{ show.place }}</small></td>
		</tr>
	{%- else %}
		<tr><td colspan="3">No upcoming shows nearby.</td></tr>
	{%- endfor %}
	</tbody>
</table>

<p><small>
List built {{ concerts.generated | readableDate("dd LLL yyyy") }} and refreshed weekly from Ticketmaster.
</small></p>
